# PCBZ render server patch 0010 (U2, the rest): the entry points an embedded host owns.
# Why: the M2 review drove the pane and found three one-click ways around the host. File > New Project, Ctrl+N, Open, Open
# recent and the Home tiles replaced the host's project (the host saves what the editor holds, so the replacement would be written
# over the bound file); Help > Connect AI assistants > Disable connection dropped the control endpoint the host's chat uses (and
# Enable would start one the host does not know); the Assistant button, its shortcut and the AI preferences page started a second
# model client (agent probes, keychain, HTTPS). Embedded: those actions show a status line instead, the AI features stay off, the
# status bar drops "Local MCP enabled". Guards only: nothing changes when the flag is false.

